{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>In Gath</b> — To the Philistines. The prophet laments over Israel and weeps over the vengeance of the Philistines and their rejoicing over Israel. And some say: this prophecy concerns the day of Jerusalem, when the Chaldeans captured it." "<b>In Beth-le-Aphrah</b> — A city in the land of Canaan." "<b>The meaning of בבית</b> — In every house." "<b>Roll yourself</b> — Like והתפלשי באפר (and roll yourself in dust). And it is written התפלשתי (I rolled myself) — the prophet's words."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:37.431089858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}